.claude/

# MapLibre's tile-parsing worker, copied out of node_modules by
# apps/web/scripts/copy-maplibre-worker.mjs on every predev/prebuild.
# Deliberately NOT committed: a checked-in copy would silently go stale against
# a newer installed maplibre-gl and reintroduce exactly the class of bug that
# script exists to fix.
apps/web/public/maplibre/

# Safety net: third-party data, model outputs and databases must never be
# committed, even if a script writes them outside artifacts/. The transit
# agencies' GTFS archives are not ours to redistribute.
*.zip
*.pkl
*.pt
*.pth
*.parquet
*.jsonl
*.sqlite
*.db
*.dump
node_modules/

# Private working notes, reviews and AI-assisted development handoffs.
# These live outside the repository and must not be copied back in.
